  "Scenes.Heldungeon.AgreeToHelpHeliaDungeon.MullProposition": "You mull the salamander's proposition over and eventually agree to assist her. Not only will you be stopping a new race of monsters from spawning into the mountains, but you'll be getting into the lovely Helia's good graces - a win-win if ever there was one."
