  "Scenes.Heldungeon.AskKiriAboutSalamander.HelDoesntKnowYet": "[pg][say: Hel doesn't know yet... I didn't want her to lose her head or do something reckless. But, yeah, that's Dad down there. I just wish... I could have done something more to help him.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.AskKiriAboutSalamander.HesFineSortOf": "[pg][say: No, no! He's fine! Er, well, as fine as he can be, all things considered. I just... uh... thought you should know: his name is Hakon en Kahlesin. He's Hel's dad. And mine.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.AskKiriAboutSalamander.HowFreeHim": "[pg]You ask how you can free him."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.AskKiriAboutSalamander.MotherKeepsKey": "[pg][say: Mother keeps the key to his hand shackles on her at all times. Brigid has the one for his legs. You'll need to defeat both to free him.]"
