  "Scenes.Heldungeon.AskKirkAboutHel.HowSheKnowsHel": "You ask the harpy girl how she knows Hel, exactly."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.AskKirkAboutHel.StammersAghast": "[pg][say: Wha - what!?] she stammers, aghast. [say: I, we, uh, I mean... Gah.] She slumps her shoulders. [say: Yeah, I guess you could say that. It's not like we're in love or anything, but, you know...] The harpy trails off with a light shrug. [say: She's been good to me.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.AskKirkAboutHel.StartsNervously": "[pg][say: Oh, uh,] she starts nervously, obviously taken aback by your question. [say: I've known Miss Helia for quite a while now. She saved my life a couple of years ago, and, well, we've been friends ever since. When I realized what was going on here - who the salamander in the dungeon was - I couldn't help but try and tell her what's up.]"
