  "Scenes.Heldungeon.GoToHeliaDungeon2.BoostHerUpWall": "[pg]You nod again, and give Helia a little boost as she starts to scale the high walls of the aging tower. You, however, steel yourself and make your way through an opening in the main gates."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.GoToHeliaDungeon2.CrestOfTower": "[pg]Eventually, you see the crest of a squat, thick stone tower on the mountainside. Hel easily guides you toward it, giving you a helping hand over an unusually wide gorge that would have kept most stray minotaurs well away from the solitary spire. As you scramble onto the tower's plateau, Hel grabs your shoulders and pins you to the ground - just in time to avoid the gaze of a low-flying harpy."
