  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.AnotherOrgasmPlows": "[pg]You slump as another orgasm plows through you, swelling the harpy's womb until she looks nine months pregnant. You barely feel it, though your skin flushes hotly as the woman plants a lust-stick kiss on your lips in thanks... Another salamander male was what the Queen needed; you weren't it, but with Hel and the captive that turned out to be her father around, she found use for you, too: breeding harpies to continue her bloodline while the phoenixes go off to war against the demons."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.AnotherOrgasmWashes": "[pg]Before you can respond, another orgasm washes over you, and a huge load of seed explodes into the thirty-first slut to claim your seed today. And over her shoulders, you can see dozens more harpies, half of them your own spawn, waiting their turn."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.AnotherSalamander": "[pg][say: Ah, another salamander? Well well, what a coincidence. I don't believe our other specimen is going to last much longer. You seem a healthy girl; with a bit of... modification... you'd make a fine replacement.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.CollapseBeforeQueen": "You collapse in front of the Harpy Queen, sitting upon her throne. She isn't particularly tall or menacing looking, but her hips are truly inhuman, thrice as wide as she is at the least, and her pillowy ass, seated upon her cushions, seems canyon-like in her nudity, the type of butt you could lose yourself in forever. The harpy matron wields a tall whitewood staff, held in the crook of her arm."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.CouldUseAnother": "[pg][say: And you,] the queen says, looking back to you. [saystart]I could always use another "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.GoodStudSince": "[pg][say: You've been a good stud since you came to me, [name],] the Queen laughs airily, patting your swollen nuts. [say: The size of my brood has quadrupled since you and Hel 'volunteered' to help us. Mmm, a free Mareth will surely have you to thank for the army that will liberate it from the demons. You might even be something of a hero, if you want. The Champion of Free Mareth, if you will. That wouldn't be so bad, would it? After all, that's why you came here...]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.HelFullBodyOrgasm": "[pg]Hel cries out, a full-body orgasm rocking through her tall frame, ending in the magically-endowed pecker between her legs, just like yours, buried to the hilt inside the broodmother harpy. The Queen coos, rubbing the gaping hole of her twat as a waterfall of salamander cum oozes out of her, pooling on the floor with the leavings of the last dozen of Hel's orgasms. Despite the orgasm subsiding from your once-lover, the Harpy Queen remains firmly impaled on Hel's giant wang, grinding her hips around in wide circles, her breeding tunnel slurping up every drop of salamander sperm it can. Finally, she pulls herself off in a long, languid motion, slowly working off the cunt-stretching tool inside her until it flops groundward, still leaking a tiny dribble of cum. Eagerly, a half-dozen lesser harpies jump toward Hel's used cock, lapping up the leftovers from the Queen's use in hopes of birthing a phoenix of their very own."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.InMyHarem": " in my harem. Yes, you'll do nicely...[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.IncubatorWord": "incubator"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.InterloperWanders": "[pg][say: So, an interloper wanders into my nest. Tell me, fool, are you working for the demons? Surely you must be. No one else would dare come here...]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.MotherHarpyCalls": "[pg][say: Mother!] a harpy calls, stepping up to the throne. Behind her come another dozen sisters, struggling to keep Hel bound between them. The salamander screams and curses and cries, but it is useless - she cannot escape, any more than you can. Hel is pushed down onto her knees beside you, still defiant, but, at seeing you already captured... the fight goes completely out of her eyes."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.NewSensationsBrokeMind": ", even if the sudden new sensations nearly broke your mind when the harpies used their magics to grow these huge male implements on your body"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.QueenStretchesWings": "[pg]The Harpy Queen stretches her wings wide as she steps away from Hel, now already being mounted by one of the Queen's daughters, and saunters over to you, salamander seed still freely leaking from her gaping egg-hole. She cups your cheek, sliding her long fingers across your sensitive, thoroughly drugged skin. Your entire body tingles as she smiles upon you, barely aware of the half-dozen sluts slurping at your spent seed as one of her daughters forces herself onto your enhanced member."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.SixMonthsLater": "[pg]<b>SIX MONTHS LATER...</b>[pg]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.SlutGetsHerFill": ". Indeed, as soon as that slut's gotten her fill, one of her sisters pushes her roughly off your shaft and mounts you, bending over and backing into your massive schlong. A little shudder of pleasure courses up your body as the twenty-ninth slut you've serviced today starts to milk you for your magically-enhanced seed. The tubes pumping enchanted drugs directly into the flesh of your testes goes into overtime, flooding your system with lust and the strange concoction that creates the phoenixes."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.SpermBankWord": "sperm bank"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.SubterraneanBreeding": "[pg]You gaze across the subterranean breeding chamber, over tables and toys covered in gallons of spent semen, to where Helia and Hakon the salamanders are chained. Hakon has long since passed out, his age and years of abuse weakening him to the point where he can only function a small part of the day. Beside him, though, Hel is awake and kicking, struggling futilely under the huge girth of the Harpy Queen's hips which pin her to the wall in place of chains."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.WellWhatHaveWe": "[pg][say: Well, well, what do we have here?] the harpy croons, licking her lips as she stares down at you. Defeated, you are utterly helpless. A pair of her brood step from the shadows and bind you, tying your arms and [legs] in thick leather straps."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenBeatsUpPCBadEnd.WristsChafing": "You groan, your wrists chafing in the manacles hanging overhead. The harpy slut riding your huge, engorged dick crosses her eyes, screams, and cums. Another wave of seed lurches out of your cripplingly-large balls, so massive that they drag on the floor between your [legs]. You shudder slightly, but the act of ejaculation has lost all meaning"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenDefeatedByPC.FinalLoudGasp": "With a final, loud gasp, the Harpy Queen collapses into her throne, unable to oppose you further. Seeing their broodmother defeated, the other harpies that had been swarming around the room suddenly break off their attack and retreat, edging back to the fringes of the throne room. Behind you, Hel stumbles out of the melee, covered in little cuts and bruises, but seeming otherwise unhurt."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenDefeatedByPC.RuinEverything": "[pg][say: Y-you'll ruin everything,] the Harpy Queen groans, trying futilely to stand. Before she can recover, Hel walks over and plants her clawed foot right on the bitch's chest, pinning her down. From a small hook on the side of the throne, you take her key-ring for the prisoner down below."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.BreedArmyTruth": "[pg][say: You heard me, fool! I meant to breed an army to turn back the demons. And I was so close! My daughters, you fought them below; were they not beautiful? And so... so very deadly.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.GoblinAlchemy": "[pg][say: Ha! Goblin alchemy. My true-born daughters brought me all that they could. I experimented for years trying to get it right. A bit of this potion and that poison... But I did it. I created the ultimate race of warriors. You might kill me, but you cannot erase my creation!]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.HadThatOneComing": "[pg]Well, you suppose you had that one coming. Next. How did she get the phoenixes in the first place? Harpies usually don't birth half-breeds."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.HeWasMarriedBitch": "[pg][say: That's because he was MARRIED, YOU BITCH!] Hel screams, her tail practically blazing behind her. The queen recoils, but falls silent."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.ItIsTheTruth": "[pg][say: It is the truth. I saw what the demons did to our world... What they wreaked upon my beautiful daughters... And I could not turn my back. So one man had to suffer! A pittance of a sacrifice to drive back the demons. With the salamander's seed, and my magic and mighty womb... An army was not beyond our reach. The phoenixes were to be the demons' downfall. Yet you seek to doom us, all for the sake of one.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.LeaningOverQueen": "Leaning over the defeated Harpy Queen, you decide to get some answers. First, you ask her why, exactly, she kidnapped a salamander in the first place. That's what brought you here, after all."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.OhReallyQuestion": "[pg]Oh really?"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.QueenSpitsAtYou": "[pg]Grunting under Hel's foot, the queen spits at you, narrowly missing your face. [say: What the fuck kind of question is that? I stole him to steal his seed, foolish [boy].]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.RuleTheWorldFool": "[pg][say: Rule the world? FOOL! That was not my intention - far from it.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.ScowlsSaysNothing": "[pg]Hel scowls, but says nothing. It doesn't seem like you'll get anything further from the queen."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.ThisOneDidNot": "[pg]The harpy queen turns her gaze toward Hel. [say: This one did not.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.WaitWhat": "[pg]Wait, what."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.WeSeeAboutThat": "[pg]You roll your eyes. We'll see about that. You ask her why she went to all that trouble of making a race of 'ultimate warriors' anyway. Since when did a harpy want to rule the world?"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenInterrogate.YouBitchSnaps": "[pg][say: You bitch!] Hel snaps, grinding her foot into the harpy's chest. [say: What the fuck is wrong with you people? Did you even think, for one fucking second, actually THINK to maybe ask one of us? Just fly down and ask any horny salamander boy, 'Wanna fill me with your seed till my eggs pop and make an army?' Guess what - he'd say yes! Any man in Mareth who's still pure at heart would say YES!]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoBerate.NoticeQueensStaff": "[pg]You notice the queen's staff has fallen beside her body."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoBerate.OfCourseYouWouldnt": "[pg][say: Of course you wouldn't understand,] Hel snaps, dropping the dead queen as she stands. [say: Your parents are probably safe and snug back in wherever the fuck you're from. Me? I had to live my whole life thinking my dad was dead; I had to watch a gang of gnolls drag my mother off to be raped to death. Fuck you anyway, [name]. What do you know?]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoBerate.RunsOutTheDoor": "[pg]Before you can say another word, the salamander runs out the door, back downstairs. Aw, shit."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoBerate.SlamFootDemand": "[pg]You angrily slam your foot down and <i>demand</i> an explanation. You remind her that her job was purely to rescue the salamander, and unnecessary killing, especially after promising them freedom, makes her out to be no better than the demons."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoBerate.StareEachOtherDown": "You and Hel stare each other down, the dead harpy's body the only thing separating you. Two dozen enraged harpies screech and caw around you, demanding justice for their fallen queen."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoForgive.AlrightYouveGotKey": "[pg][saystart]Alright. You've got the key, so go break "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoForgive.ConsideringEmotions": "[pg]Considering all of the emotions that she must be going through right now, you reluctantly forgive her for her actions."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoForgive.DadWord": "Dad "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoForgive.EyesLightUp": "[pg]Her eyes light up. Not the reaction she was expecting, it seems. [say: So... we're good?]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoForgive.HelTrotsOut": "[pg]With that, Hel trots out the door and down the stairs, leaving you alone in the room. You notice that the queen's staff has fallen beside her body."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoForgive.OutOfTheDungeon": "out of the dungeon. I'll make sure the phoenixes and harpies don't give you two trouble on the way out.[sayend]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoForgive.StareEachOtherDown": "You and Hel stare each other down, the dead harpy's body the only thing separating you. Two dozen enraged harpies screech and caw around you, demanding justice for their fallen queen."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoForgive.TellHarpiesGetLost": "[pg]You pat Helia on the head and with a shout, tell the harpies to get lost. They do so reluctantly, too afraid to fight you, but still outraged at the murder. They take flight, hurtling out the hole in the ceiling crying curses and epitaphs behind them."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoForgive.ThatPoorSalamander": "that poor salamander "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoForgive.TightHugThanks": "[pg]She stands up from the body and wraps you in a tight hug. [say: ...Thank you.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.HarpyQueenLetHerGoForgive.YouNod": "[pg]You nod."
