  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixMissionary.SquirmsAsYouPush": "[pg]The phoenix squirms as you push into her depths, groaning as more and more of your cockmeat pierces her until you finally hilt her. Gritting her teeth, the phoenix reaches up and grabs your shoulders, holding onto you as your cock"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixMissionary.UpWithHerHole": " up with her hole"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixPlatoonLosesToPC.FinalGruntCollapses": "With one final grunt, the last of the phoenixes collapses onto the pile of defeated warriors you've left in your wake. The once-mighty platoon of soldiers has been reduced to a bruised, lusty heap of flesh, scales and feathers. Seeing that the battle is won, you lower your [weapon] and take a look around."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixPlatoonMurdersPC.BadlyInjuredWord": "badly injured"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixPlatoonMurdersPC.CollapseToo": "You collapse, too "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixPlatoonMurdersPC.GonerBringToMom": "[pg][say: Yeah,] another says. [say: This one's a goner. Let's bring [him] up to Mom.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixPlatoonMurdersPC.ToContinueTheFight": " to continue the fight. The platoon of heavy infantry breaks their formation, circling around you with shields still raised, keeping you from making any kind of last-ditch attack. One prods you with the flat of her blade. [say: Is [he] down?]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixPlatoonMurdersPC.TurnedOnWord": "turned on"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixWanking.ExplodesThickLoad": "[pg]Your [cock {0}] explodes, pumping a thick load into the shocked phoenix's mouth. She gags on your cum, finally swallowing it as the last of your sperm drips into her mouth. With a grin, you tell her what a good job she did as you withdraw your [cock {1}] from her grip. With little rivulets of cum dripping down her face, the half-breed collapses onto her back, rapidly fingering herself."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixWanking.FeelsHeavenly": "[pg]It feels heavenly, and you shudder with delight as her warm, scaly tail rubs and strokes and squeezes you... But it isn't quite enough, not with so many other parts of her left! You push her looped tail off the tip of your [cock {0}] and tell the phoenix to put her soft, feathery red wings to good use. She gawks at you, but a quick grope of her tits urges her to the task. She furls her auburn wings around her shoulders, letting the fringes stroke and caress the sensitive [cockHead {1}] of your cock. You barely contain yourself at the downy touch of her feathers along your [cock {2}]'s head and length, and urge her onwards with encouraging words and more gentle, loving squeezes and teases of her lush tits."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixWanking.FingeringHerself": "[pg]You notice that by now the phoenix-girl is openly fingering herself. You continue to run your fingers through her hair, whispering encouragements and sweet nothings at her as she continues to squeeze and gently caress your [cock {0}]. You feel your orgasm coming, and quickly grab the phoenix by the shoulders and push her forward, forcing her to take your cockhead into her mouth as you cum."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixWanking.GrabHealthiestPhoenix": "You grab the healthiest looking phoenix off the top of the pile and throw the hermaphrodite on her back a few feet from her sisters. She grunts, looking up at you with grim, fierce eyes. [say: I'll never submit! I am a proud warrior, not some-] Yeah, whatever. You rip her chain shirt open, revealing the large, soft globes of her D-cups beneath. The phoenix gasps at the sudden exposure and turns her head away, determined not to look you in the eye as you take your pleasure. You grope one of her breasts roughly, pinching the nipple between your fingers until she's whimpering with pain and pleasure. You let up for just a moment and tell the girl that she's going to get you off with her special endowments, or you're going to put her in a world of hurt."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.PhoenixWanking.GroanNods": "[pg]With a groan, she nods her head. You release her sensitive breast and present your [cock {0}]. Reluctantly, the phoenix-girl brings her fiery tail around and, extinguishing it, begins to snake it around your prick. You urge her on as she wraps her long, prehensile appendage around your shaft, wringing it like a sponge as her tail's grip tightens. You run your hands through the girl's bright red hair, stroking her gently as she starts to jerk your [cock {1}] off with her tail."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RefuseGooArmorOffer.HuffsIndignantly": "[pg]She huffs indignantly and scrambles to her feet. [say: Well fine, and fuck you anyway. I hope you get raped by harpies, [madam].] After a moment, she hesitantly adds, [say: But if you change your mind later... Well, we'll see if you live through this place without me!] Before you can stop her, she ducks out the front door and off to... Wherever goo-armor-girl-things would go, you guess. Still, to your surprise, you feel rather invigorated after the battle, and rolling your shoulders, you turn your attention back to the dungeon ahead."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RefuseGooArmorOffer.HuffsIndignantlyAgain": "[pg]She huffs indignantly and scrambles to her feet. [say: Well fine, and fuck you anyway. I hope you get raped by jotuns, [madam].] After a moment, she hesitantly adds, [say: But if you change your mind later... Well, I guess I'll be around here!] Before you can stop her, she huffs off to... wherever goo-armor-girl-things would go, you guess. You make your way back to your camp."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RefuseGooArmorOffer.TellFuckOffAgain": "You tell her to fuck off -- you don't need armor that might try to kill or rape you at night."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RefuseGooArmorOffer.TellHerFuckOff": "You tell her to fuck off -- you don't need armor that might try to kill or rape you at night."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RefuseGooArmorOfferPolitely.HuffsIndignantly": "[pg]She huffs indignantly and scrambles to her feet. [say: Well fine, maybe you can take me later, [madam]?] After a moment, she hesitantly adds, [say: But if you change your mind later... Well, we'll see if you live through this place without me! But if you need me later, I'll be in the glacial rift.] Before you can stop her, she ducks out the front door and off to... Wherever goo-armor-girl-things would go, you guess. Still, to your surprise, you feel rather invigorated after the battle, and rolling your shoulders, you turn your attention back to the dungeon ahead."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RefuseGooArmorOfferPolitely.HuffsIndignantlyAgain": "[pg]She huffs indignantly and scrambles to her feet. [say: Well fine, maybe you can take me later, [madam]?] After a moment, she hesitantly adds, [say: But if you change your mind later... You know where to find me, right?] You give her a nod as you make your way back to your camp."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RefuseGooArmorOfferPolitely.NoThanksNotNow": "You tell her that... no thanks, not now -- you don't need armor right now."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RefuseGooArmorOfferPolitely.NotNowAgain": "You tell her that... no thanks, not now -- you don't need armor right now."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RetryDungeonFromBadEndPrompt.LikeToRetry": "Would you like to retry?"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.ReturnToHeliaDungeon.HikeUpAgain": "You once again hike up the narrow ledges and crevices of the high mountains towards a familiar snow-capped peak. Eventually, you make your way back to the squat, thick stone tower on the mountainside."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomCellar.CeilingSoLow": "a ceiling so low you have to crouch"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomCellar.DroppedIntoHideyHole": "You've dropped down into a small underground hidey-hole, with "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomCellar.FewHornsOfMead": "You see a few horns of mead slung up in a wine rack - they smell a bit pungent, but alcohol improves with age they say... "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomCellar.GodsMeadHere": "There {0} {1} God's Mead {2} here to take.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomCellar.JustEnoughRoom": "just enough room to stand up in"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomCellar.NothingHorrifying": ". To your surprise, nothing horrifying jumps out and tries to rape you. "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomCellar.WineCellarHeading": "<b><u>Wine Cellar</u></b>\n"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomCellar.WineRackEmpty": "The wine rack is empty. You have already looted all the horns of mead."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomDungeon.BoutTimeMadeIt": "[pg][say: 'Bout time you made it down here, you {0}. Mama Brigid's been waiting a loooong time for someone to try and break out one of her toys.] She pats the hefty keyring on the underside of her shield and leers at you."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomDungeon.DownstairsSmokyRoom": "You make your way downstairs into a small, smoky stone room. A thick smell of steam and burnt meat hangs over the room, making you cough as you descend the stairs. As you make your way into the tower's little dungeon, you quickly notice the salamander chained to a table. He's a great big man, nearly eight feet tall and covered in scars. He has short, spiky red hair, the same color as his tail and limb scales, and a black eyepatch covers his left socket. He looks like hell, emaciated and exhausted, covered in thick cum-stains from being used an untold number of times by the harpies of the tower."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomDungeon.DungeonHeading": "<b><u>Dungeon</u></b>\n"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomDungeon.DungeonRoomEmpty": "You're standing in a small dungeon room, nearly gagging on the smells of burnt meat and smoke. A number of nasty torture devices hang on the walls, and an empty table sits in the middle of the room."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomDungeon.DungeonRoomPrisoner": "You're standing in a small dungeon room, nearly gagging on the smells of burnt meat and smoke. A number of nasty torture devices hang on the walls, and a table sits in the middle of the room, "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomDungeon.HaveTheKeys": "[pg]<b>You have the keys to release the prisoner. You may be able to return in the future by choosing \"Phoenix Tower\" from the dungeons submenu.</b>"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomDungeon.OnWhichHakonLies": "on which Hakon lies"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomDungeon.OnWhichPrisonerLies": "on which the salamander prisoner lies"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomDungeon.ReadyWeaponTakeKeys": "[pg]You ready your [weapon] and prepare to take the keys from her!"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomDungeon.SentencePeriod": "."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomDungeon.TallestHarpyBrigid": "[pg]Beside him, though, is the tallest harpy you've ever seen. A foot over most of her sisters, she stands stark naked save for a red-hot iron poker in her hand and a heavy iron shield in the other. Her pink hair is shaved down to a mohawk, and her face is covered with a dozen iron studs and rings."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomGuardHall.AlreadyClearedTower": "[pg]You have already cleared this tower. You can leave if you like to."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomGuardHall.GuardHallHeading": "<b><u>Guard Hall</u></b>\n"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomGuardHall.GuardRoomRansacked": "You stand in what might have been a guard room once upon a time. Now it is a ruined, ransacked mess. It seems not to have been used in years, and the table, chairs, and spears lined up against the wall have all rotted away to almost nothing."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomGuardHall.HeavyIronDoors": " You see a pair of heavy iron doors leading northward, though they seem so rusty and heavy that opening them is sure to alert anyone nearby, and a small trapdoor leading down."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomGuardHall.RackAppearsEmpty": " You recall there was a suit of half-plate armor. The rack appears to be empty."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomGuardHall.SuitOfHalfPlate": " However, a suit of half-plate armor has been left up against the eastern wall, hanging loosely on a rack; it seems to be in usable shape."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomMezzanine.AscendStepsPhoenixes": "You ascend the heavy stone steps, circling the tower's walls as you ascend. You are stopped perhaps half-way to the second main floor on a small terrace level with a wide open view overlooking the vale beneath the high mountains. As you step onto the mezzanine, you watch with a scowl as a number of tall, muscular hermaphrodites step out from the shadows. Each is clad in heavy chainmail, wielding a spear and a blood-red shield, but is otherwise nude, revealing their reptilian pricks and slick pussies. The soldiers standing before you look like harpies, but they have scaled, humanoid legs, long, fiery tails and their wings are the darkest crimson. These are phoenixes - the dread half-breed warriors you and Hel are here to stop!"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomMezzanine.MezzanineEmpty": "You're standing in the Mezzanine of the tower, a small terrace with a magnificent view of the High Mountains and the valleys below. There are stairs leading up and down from here."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomMezzanine.MezzanineHeading": "<b><u>Mezzanine</u></b>\n"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomMezzanine.MezzaninePhoenixesPile": "You're standing in the Mezzanine of the tower, a small terrace with a magnificent view of the High Mountains and the valleys below. There are stairs leading up and down from here, as well as a pile of defeated phoenixes that don't look like they'll be recovering for a bit."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomStairwell.DruggedHarpiesAgain": "There's a pile of drugged, unconscious harpies you've already defeated on the floor. Kiri appears to have left."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomStairwell.ItsAFight": "[pg]It's a fight!"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomStairwell.LargeRoomStairwell": "You're in a large room. There is a wide open stairwell. Ever since your last visit, the room is awfully empty. To the south is a pair of large, open double doors. You can go downstairs into the dungeon or climb up the stairs to the mezzanine."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomStairwell.OpenHeavyDoors": "You open the heavy double doors and cringe as a loud [say: SCREECH!] echoes out and up the next room - a wide open stairwell, it seems, with minimal cover. The perfect place for a harpy to fight... Oh, shit!"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomStairwell.PileOfDruggedHarpies": "There's a pile of drugged, unconscious harpies you've already defeated on the floor, as well as Kiri, the only one that didn't attack you. You recall that she knows Hel and is here to help the both of you."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomStairwell.ReadyWeaponWing": "[pg]You ready your [weapon] as a wing of harpies looks up from eating at a small table in the center of the stone stairwell, all staring at you with wide, astonished eyes. Another few harpies peer down from above, poking their heads down the stairs to get a look at the intruder. Almost in unison, they jump to their feet and bare their claws."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomStairwell.StairWellHeading": "<b><u>Stair Well</u></b>\n"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.AscendingStairsDoors": "Ascending the stairs, you are stopped by a pair of heavy double doors. They're covered with rotting, chipped purple paint and laurels that look years old. The sharp, screeching sounds of metal on metal ring out in the next room - the sounds of a fight! You kick the door open, and charge into what must be some kind of throne room; a large carpet dominates your view, leading up to a towering throne surrounded by pillows and cushions, currently vacant."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.HelGrabsTwoHarpies": "[pg]Before you can say a word, Hel grabs a pair of harpies and, using them like human battering rams, dives into the swirling maelstrom of talons and claws. You turn, [weapon] raised, to face down the queen."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.HelSpinsBesideYou": "[pg]Seeing you in the corner of her eye, Hel spins out of the contest and comes to stand beside you, blade raised toward the harpy broodmother."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.HelVsBroodmother": "[pg]In the center of the throne room stand Helia the Salamander and a harpy that could only be described as a broodmother. She isn't particularly tall or menacing looking, but her hips are truly inhuman, thrice as wide as she is at the least, and her pillowy ass seems canyon-like in her nudity, the type of butt you could lose yourself in forever. The harpy matron, wielding a staff, is currently locked in a fierce battle against Hel's red-hot scimitar."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.IdiotSheSneers": "[pg]She now sits upon her throne, her staff laid across her bird-like legs. [say: Idiot,] she sneers, just loud enough to be heard over the din of battle. [say: You've doomed us all. So many of my daughters dead or beaten or fled... No, I will not allow you to go unpunished, even if it means my life.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.IgnoreHerPosition": "[pg]You ignore her, focusing on getting into position for a quick take-down with the help of your salamander lover. However, before you can back the Harpy Queen into a corner, you hear an explosive BOOM from above. You look up in time to see a hole erupt in the tower's ceiling, and a great brood of harpies pour in, dozens of them at the least."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.OhWellFuckMe": "[pg][say: Oh well, fuck me!] Hel screams, dodging a hail of blows as the harpies swarm the throne room. You can only just hear the broodmother laughing, bidding her children onwards over the sound of screeching and beating wings."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.QueenSlumpsInsensate": " The Harpy Queen slumps in her throne, insensate."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.ReassuringNod": "[pg]You give Hel a reassuring nod and start to circle toward the Harpy Queen, taking the left flank while Hel heads right. The queen looks from one of you to the other, a ball of white-hot magic fire conjured in her hand."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.TakePieceOfAction": "[pg][say: FUCK! [name]!] Hel yells, cleaving a harpy in two with her scimitar, [say: Take a piece of the action; get the queen. I've got these bitches!]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.ThroneRoomEmpty": "You stand in the harpy throne room - a long, circular room dominated by a high throne surrounded by cushions and drapes. A single long carpet flows from the heavy double doors to the throne, reminding you of a castle's great hall in days gone by. "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.ThroneRoomHarpiesCower": "You stand in the harpy throne room - a long, circular room dominated by a high throne surrounded by cushions and drapes. A single long carpet flows from the heavy double doors to the throne, reminding you of a castle's great hall in days gone by. A number of harpies cower in the shadows, afraid to oppose you further now that their mighty leader is defeated."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.ThroneRoomHeading": "<b><u>Throne Room</u></b>\n"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.TookYourSweetTime": "[pg][say: [name]!] she says, giving you a teasing slap on the ass with her tail. [say: Took your sweet time, didn't you? Here I was starting to think I'd get this bitch all to myself!]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.UnseenForceSlamsDoor": "[pg]<b>An unseen force slams the door shut, preventing you from escape. It's a fight!</b>"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.WhitewoodStaffFire": "[pg]She stands, grabbing her great whitewood staff. A ball of magical whitefire forms in her hand, ready to sear you alive."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.RoomThroneRoom.YouFoolsHisses": "[pg][say: You fools!] the queen hisses, backing away from you as best she can. [say: You know not what you do! My children... Their sole purpose was for the good of Mareth! You have ruined everything! Now the demons will have us all.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TakeGooArmor.ArmorRackSuit": "You approach the armor rack. A suit of heavy plated armor sits upon it, overlaying a flexible chain vest. Contrasting against the rotting room, the armor seems to be in pristine condition, even shining. Perhaps someone uses this heavy equipment - but surely not a harpy? You suppose you could take it."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TakeGooArmor4Realz.ArmoredGooGrowls": "[pg]Quietly, the armored goo-girl growls, [say: You dare to disturb my rest, mortal? Prepare yourself for my vengeance!]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TakeGooArmor4Realz.ReachOutToGrab": "You reach out to grab the armor, but as soon as your finger brushes the shiny surface, a human-like face appears in the helm! You recoil as a daintily feminine and bright blue face takes shape out of nowhere, staring at you with eyes afire with rage. More of the gooey substance that makes up the girl's face fills out the armor, yanking it off the racks on feet made of goop."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TakeGooArmor4Realz.WhatTheFuckFight": "[pg]What the fuck!? Oh well, looks like she wants a fight!"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TakeGooArmorAndWearIt.FeelInvigorated": "[pg]To your surprise, you feel rather invigorated after the battle, thanks to Valeria's strange healing properties, and with a smirk, you turn your attention back to the {0} ahead.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TakeQueensStaff.PickUpQueensStaff": "You pick up the Harpy Queen's staff. It is a tall whitewood staff, nearly six feet in length, and covered in glowing eldritch runes, with a singular shimmering sphere of crystal at its head, which seems to have a swirling mist within.[pg]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TalkToKiri.AskShareInfo": "You ask Kiri if she wouldn't mind sharing a bit of information with you."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TalkToKiri.OfCoursePleasantly": "[pg][say: Of course,] she says pleasantly, [say: that's what I'm here for! What do you want to know?]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TalkToValeria.AskWhatSheThinks": "Now that you have a few moments to catch your breath, you ask your goo-armor what she thinks about the situation."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TalkToValeria.BrigidTheJailer": "[pg][say: Brigid the Jailer is a big girl, probably the meanest harpy here. The others give her plenty of space, from what I've seen. She uses a hot poker as her weapon, too. Watch out unless you wanna get burned!]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TalkToValeria.BroodmotherSerious": "[pg][say: Oh, right. Well, that harpy broodmother is serious business. She's a powerful mage, and a heavy-hitter besides. Careful with her, or you're liable to end up drugged out of your mind and used as breeding stock 'till you die. I've seen it happen to other adventurers coming through.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TalkToValeria.ClearThroatRepeat": "[pg]You clear your throat and repeat your question."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TalkToValeria.FreakyHalfBreeds": "[pg][say: There's some freaky-ass half-breed harpy things upstairs that I've seen around a bit. Phoenixes, I guess they're called. They breathe fire, so watch your ass. I can absorb some of the heat, but... Don't get roasted, okay?]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TalkToValeria.OhHiLaughs": "[pg][say: Oh, hi,] she laughs. She pours half-way out of your armor, forming her face a few inches from yours. Kiri leaps in shock, wide-eyed as your armor becomes a new person before you."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TalkToValeria.WellHeyThereCutie": "[pg][say: Well hey there, cutie,] Valeria says, giving Kiri a little wink. The harpy shudders slightly and shakes the surprise off."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TortureGear.CommaSpace": ", "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TortureGear.CommaSpaceAgain": ", "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TortureGear.LeatherStrapsWord": "some leather straps"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TortureGear.LustDraftDagger": "a lust-draft coated dagger"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TortureGear.PeriodSpace": ". "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TortureGear.RackContains": "The rack contains: "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TortureGear.RackIsEmpty": "The rack is empty."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TortureGear.WalkUpToRack": "You walk up to the torture rack. "
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TortureGear.WhipWord": "A whip"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.DaddyGleefulCry": "[pg]Behind you, you hear a sudden, gleeful cry: [say: DADDY!]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.HakonTurnsHelLeaps": "[pg]Hakon turns just in time as Hel leaps into his arms, followed shortly by her phoenix half-sister Kiri. You can see tears streaming down the girls' faces -- and, you think, Hakon's too -- streaming off them as a father is finally reunited with his daughters..."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.HelAndKiriTurn": "[pg]Hel and Kiri turn to you, smiling from ear to ear as you bring Hakon outside."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.HelAsksCrying": "[pg][say: Is it... really you? Dad?] Hel asks, openly crying. You don't think she's ever seen her father before."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.HelpHakonOutKnows": "With Hakon's arm slung over your shoulder, you help the long-imprisoned salamander up the stairs and, with great effort, out the ancient doors of the tower. Outside, you're treated to a sweeping expanse of mountain; it's a gorgeous vista, with the great rocky spires and crags surrounding you until the sun is just a glimmer in the distant. Hakon squints, covering his eyes as he is bathed in daylight for the first time in years."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.HelpHakonOutSurprise": "With Hakon's arm slung over your shoulder, you help the long-imprisoned salamander up the stairs and, with great effort, out the ancient doors of the tower. Outside, you see Helia and her pseudo-phoenix half-sister Kiri. Hakon recoils as the evening sunlight hits his eyes, his first taste of the sun in years."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.KiriTakesHand": "[pg][say: Hel,] Kiri says, taking the salamander by the hand. [say: I've got someone you might want to meet.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.LaughDownMountain": "[pg]You laugh, shake your head, and start your way down the mountain."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.LaughDownMountainKnows": "[pg]You laugh, shake your head, and start your way down the mountain."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.LeapsIntoHisArms": "[pg]Before 'old scales' can finish his thought, Hel leaps into his arms, hugging him tightly. You can see tears streaming down her face - and, you think, his too - streaming off them as the two salamanders embrace."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.LoverMineChuckles": "[pg][say: Lover mine?] Hakon says, chuckling. [say: I think we have a lot to talk about on the way down, little girl.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.LoverMineChucklesKnows": "[pg][say: Lover mine?] Hakon says, chuckling. [say: I think we have a lot to talk about on the way down, little girl.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.NeverLeavingYouKnows": "[pg][say: It is, little Hel. And I'm never leaving you again.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.NeverLeavingYouSurprise": "[pg][say: It is, little Hel. And I'm never leaving you again.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.OldScalesIsIt": "[pg][say: Old scales, is it?] Hakon says, grinning ear to ear. [say: Lemme tell you something, little girl. I - OOF!]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.OldScalesWeakGrin": "[pg]The elder salamander manages a weak grin as his unknowing daughter walks over to him and extends a hand. [say: Hey there, old scales. Name's Helia - Hel for short - and I... Why is everyone looking at me like that?]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.ReallyYouDad": "[pg][say: Is it... really you? Dad?]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.StoopKnows": "[pg]You spend the next few hours sitting on the stoop of the tower, watching as the long-estranged family has a chance to get to know each other again. You smile the entire time as Hel, Hakon, and Kiri are soon teasing and playing with each other as if they had always been together."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.StoopSurprise": "[pg]You spend the next few hours sitting on the stoop of the tower, watching as the long-estranged family has a chance to get to know each other again. You smile the entire time as Hel, Hakon, and Kiri are soon teasing and playing with each other as if they had always been together."
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.ThisIsOurDad": "[pg][say: Hel,] Kiri says, [say: this is... our dad. Hakon.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.TimeGoThanksKnows": "[pg]Eventually, it's time to go. With an arm around his daughters, Hakon steps up to you. [say: {0}, I can't thank you enough. Not for freeing me, but for... For reintroducing me to my family. If you ever need anything, you don't hesitate to ask. If by my life or sword I can help you, I will, without hesitation.]"
  "Scenes.Heldungeon.TowerOutro.TimeGoThanksSurprise": "[pg]Eventually, it's time to go. With an arm around his daughters, Hakon steps up to you. [say: {0}, I can't thank you enough. Not for freeing me, but for... For reintroducing me to my family. If you ever need anything, you don't hesitate to ask. If by my life or sword I can help you, I will, without hesitation.]"
